{
  "answer": "GET /admin/reports/latency → ReportsController.latency(query) → ReportsService.latency(query) → ReportsRepository.findLatency(range, query.limit, query.endpoint) → ClickHouseService.query<LatencyRow>().\n\nThe service resolves query.from/query.to into a time range. The repository queries endpoint_latency_stats with bound time, limit, and optional endpoint parameters. It groups by endpoint and method, calculates request count and avg/p50/p95/p99 latency, and orders by p95 descending. ClickHouseService executes the SQL through client.query. The service returns { data, meta: { from, to } }; the controller returns that report or CSV when requested.",
